---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Journal" description="Insights into luxury branding, heirloom stationery, and corporate gifting in Nairobi.">
  <main class="py-24 px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-20">
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-serif italic mb-4">The Journal.</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Curation & Craft</p>
    </header>

    <article class="group cursor-pointer mb-24">
      <div class="overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <img src="/images/luxury-wedding-invitations-nairobi-mauve.jpg" 
             alt="Luxury Mauve Wedding Invitations in Kenya" 
             class="w-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition duration-700"/>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif mb-4 italic">The Return to Tactile Luxury in 2026</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        In the age of digital noise, Nairobi's elite are returning to physical legacy. From <strong>bespoke vow books</strong> in Karen to <strong>architectural wax seals</strong> for corporate milestones in Westlands, we explore why physical branding is the ultimate power move this year.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="border-b border-black pb-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Read Article</a>
    </article>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-serif italic mb-2">Executive Gifting Trends</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-loose">Why custom matte black gift sets are dominating the Nairobi boardroom in 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-serif italic mb-2">Sustainability in Stationery</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-loose">The rise of seed-paper and artisanal mills in the Kenyan wedding industry.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
